 `record_usage`, `preview_invoice`, and `change_tier_and_preview` to use versioned cache lookups/stores, invalidate stale entries, and return defensive deep copies.\n\n### Verification\n- `python -m pytest -q`: `1 passed in 0.02s`.\n- End-to-end `python -c` verification script covering `BillingAPI`, `TenantStore`, `InvoiceCache`, and `calculate_invoice`: `ALL CHECKS PASSED`.\n","duration_seconds":65.7984499,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":46912,"output_tokens":10066,"thinking_tokens":2579,"cache_read_tokens":195665,"total_tokens":56978}}}
